OL,3,GNEWSASinging Bus Driver in running for
OL,4,Atop award
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus driver who has a 52-page folder
OL,7,Fof compliments from customers across
OL,8,FEastbourne and Bexhill is in the
OL,9,Frunning for a top award.
OL,11,FIain Strachan, known as Eastbourne's
OL,12,F'Singing Bus Driver' is shortlisted for
OL,13,FTop National Bus Driver at the UK Bus
OL,14,FAwards 2026.
OL,16,FStrachan, who joined Stagecoach in
OL,17,F2018, has also received a further 16
OL,18,Fcommendations submitted through the
OL,19,Fcompany's official customer service
OL,20,Fchannels.
